{"id":"n15891-1-7","stage":2,"title":"방면 · 方向","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n15891-1-7-1","ko":"이쪽에서 지하철을 타면 시내 방면으로 가지요?","zh":"从这边坐地铁的话，是往市区方向吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"이쪽에서","meaning":"这边","explanation":"이쪽：这边；에서：格助词，表示动作发生的地点或出发点。","readings":[{"term":"이쪽","audio":"/audio/ceea9a2e61410973dfd8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71694","senseId":"1","lemma":"이쪽","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이쪽에서","audio":"/audio/8d3362de33cc025d3859.mp3"}},{"text":"지하철을","meaning":"地铁","explanation":"지하철：地铁；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"지하철","audio":"/audio/dfb8c73b9f048c3b7e27.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71490","senseId":"1","lemma":"지하철","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"지하철을","audio":"/audio/30d5cb57054b2582ebec.mp3"}},{"text":"타면","meaning":"乘，乘坐","explanation":"타다：乘，乘坐；면：表示条件或假设：“如果、若、……的话”。","readings":[{"term":"타다","audio":"/audio/8f835109fdc29a59b6ab.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17160","senseId":"1","lemma":"타다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"타면","audio":"/audio/e6787c8aeca044fdc74a.mp3"}},{"text":"시내","meaning":"市内，市里","explanation":"시내：市内，市里","readings":[{"term":"시내","audio":"/audio/47aebe2586c6cf8d52e3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65118","senseId":"1","lemma":"시내","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"시내","audio":"/audio/47aebe2586c6cf8d52e3.mp3"}},{"text":"방면으로","meaning":"方向","explanation":"방면：方向；으로：表示方向、方式、手段、材料、身份或原因等关系。","readings":[{"term":"방면","audio":"/audio/8772fa78d9f63bc38800.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15891","senseId":"1","lemma":"방면","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"방면으로","audio":"/audio/f59e7c8a838fe335588f.mp3"}},{"text":"가지요?","meaning":"去","explanation":"가다：去；지요：礼貌地确认、提醒或表达意愿；죠 是 지요 的缩略。","readings":[{"term":"가다","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27500","senseId":"1","le